      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>group</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>Group is the group of the referent. For example, "gateway.networking.k8s.io". When unspecified or empty string, core API group is inferred.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>kind</code></TableCell>
